    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d572">

                <pb facs="0615" n="511" sameAs="frus:frus1932v05/pg511"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.6363/129: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Culbertson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1172</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-06-06">June 6,
                        1932</date>.<lb/>[Received June 16.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that, in
                    accordance with the Department’s telegram No. 24 of May 28, 2 p.m., I submitted
                    on June 3, to the Minister for Foreign Affairs, a formal note on the proposed
                    oil monopoly. A copy is enclosed herewith.<anchor n="67" xml:id="d572-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. S. Culbertson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
